{"3870220": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Doomsday.Inc", "steam_appid": 3870220, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead a cult as the Apocalypse Manager!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomsday.Inc is a satirical strategy game where you manage a doomsday cult. Forget robes and daggers—your main tool is the city map, and your followers are a valuable, if not always bright, human resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/bf60298a42646c55297ca4d3081645ae.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Your task is to manage a group of unique cultists. Each has their own skills, traits, and quirks. Send them on assignments: let them recruit new acolytes in residential areas, acquire resources from shady establishments, or embark on dangerous missions for powerful artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/d4aa1b7515a59ba0ded105613a645128.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Every action attracts the **Attention** of authorities, the press, and rival organizations. The higher the Attention, the closer the crisis—police raids, lawsuits, and other troubles. You'll have to balance on the edge, as the most valuable rewards require the boldest moves. Are you willing to risk your best acolyte for a chance to steal a sacred artifact?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/34627c01d0bb1eb26d2641dc49832a48.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    The path to the end of the world is paved with difficult decisions. Dynamic events will constantly test your management skills. An informant threatens to expose your secrets? Followers demand a 'karaoke night' to boost morale? Every choice you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/c5eadbeadec2c2276116d3e46d61b78a.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Invest resources into researching ancient rituals. Unlock permanent bonuses for your cult, learn new abilities, and perform multi-stage rites capable of changing the rules of the game and bringing you closer to your final victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you lead the world to its foreordained end, or will your grand plan drown in bureaucratic chaos?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lead a cult as the Apocalypse Manager!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doomsday.Inc is a satirical strategy game where you manage a doomsday cult. Forget robes and daggers—your main tool is the city map, and your followers are a valuable, if not always bright, human resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits you:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/bf60298a42646c55297ca4d3081645ae.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Your task is to manage a group of unique cultists. Each has their own skills, traits, and quirks. Send them on assignments: let them recruit new acolytes in residential areas, acquire resources from shady establishments, or embark on dangerous missions for powerful artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/d4aa1b7515a59ba0ded105613a645128.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Every action attracts the **Attention** of authorities, the press, and rival organizations. The higher the Attention, the closer the crisis—police raids, lawsuits, and other troubles. You'll have to balance on the edge, as the most valuable rewards require the boldest moves. Are you willing to risk your best acolyte for a chance to steal a sacred artifact?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/34627c01d0bb1eb26d2641dc49832a48.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    The path to the end of the world is paved with difficult decisions. Dynamic events will constantly test your management skills. An informant threatens to expose your secrets? Followers demand a 'karaoke night' to boost morale? Every choice you make has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/extras/c5eadbeadec2c2276116d3e46d61b78a.avif?t=1767902849\" width=1170 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Invest resources into researching ancient rituals. Unlock permanent bonuses for your cult, learn new abilities, and perform multi-stage rites capable of changing the rules of the game and bringing you closer to your final victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you lead the world to its foreordained end, or will your grand plan drown in bureaucratic chaos?</p>", "short_description": "Lead a doomsday cult as... a project manager. Doomsday.Inc is a satirical strategy game where you'll manage crazed acolytes, bureaucracy, and divine ambitions. Can you bring about the end of the world without getting bogged down in paperwork?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/7f20e39920c240edab7ff81a55c5d4f17b015c56/header.jpg?t=1767902849", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/7286d4acab88db8f8d4b52e122a3fadecec6526a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767902849", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3870220/7286d4acab88db8f8d4b52e122a3fadecec6526a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767902849", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support.<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphics card with DX10 (shader model 4.0) capabilities.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Tarakan Game Studio"], "publishers": ["Tarakan Game Studio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 799, "final": 799, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$7.99"}, "packages": [1360473], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Doomsday.Inc", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1360473, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "Doomsday.Inc -